wh40k-class-specialization-soldier-fire-line-name = Steel Curtain
wh40k-class-specialization-soldier-fire-line-description = Automatic fire, suppression, and sector control.

wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-01-name = Fire Doctrine
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-01-description = Unlocks the machine-gunner stance. Branch effects require a suitable automatic weapon.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-02-name = Heavy Grip
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-02-description = Reduces spread growth during long bursts without negating heat, reloads, or ammunition use.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-03-name = First Box
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-03-description = The first magazine change after combat starts is faster if the Soldier was not knocked down.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-04-name = Dig In
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-04-description = Takes a fixed position by a suitable surface, improving weapon control while limiting turning and movement. Requires the shared firing-position mechanic.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-05-name = Suppression Mode
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-05-description = Fire into a marked sector briefly suppresses hostile NPCs, hindering movement and aimed fire. It never deals damage through walls.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-06-name = Unbroken Belt
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-06-description = Hits on a suppressed target slightly slow spread buildup; changing weapon or position removes the effect.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-07-name = Sector Watcher
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-07-description = Shows suppressed-target count and remaining duration; it grants no gameplay bonus without active suppression.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-08-name = Rush the Emplacement
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-08-description = Quickly moves to the Soldier's deployed heavy bolter or fixed point within limited range and along a clear path. Requires collision and ownership checks.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-09-name = Barrel Change
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-09-description = Clears accumulated heat or sustained-fire penalties during a short vulnerable pause; it creates no ammunition and does not reload.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-10-name = Fire Discipline
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-10-description = The first shots of a controlled burst are more accurate than endless trigger-held fire.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-11-name = Rake the Formation
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-11-description = With suitable weapon and ammunition, a projectile may penetrate one extra soft target. Walls, airlocks, and armor still protect.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-12-name = Barrage Cone
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-12-description = Briefly defines a wide firing sector; visible hostile NPCs inside are suppressed while fire continues.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-13-name = Armor-Piercing Habit
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-13-description = A shot at a marked heavy target gains a small penetration bonus without turning ordinary rounds into universal armor-piercing ammunition.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-14-name = Cover the Reload
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-14-description = Warns the group about a reload and keeps the last sector suppressed for a few moments; existing suppression is required.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-15-name = Fixed Target
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-15-description = Holding a firing position reduces spread, but any meaningful step immediately resets the buildup.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-16-name = Line of Death
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-16-description = Once per cooldown, fixes a narrow firing line; first hits on different targets along it increase suppression rather than damage.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-17-name = Shoulder Feed
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-17-description = A nearby ally may assist a heavy reload through interaction; a lone Soldier receives no automatic bonus.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-18-name = Hold Fast
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-18-description = While holding position under fire, the first enemy suppression does not interrupt a reload or barrel change.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-19-name = “Down!” Order
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-19-description = A powerful sector suppression command makes hostile NPCs seek cover and clearly warns allies of the dangerous line. Requires suppression-aware AI.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-20-name = Fortress of Fire
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-fire-line-20-description = Final node: combines firing position, suppression, and spread control into one capped modifier that requires a deployed suitable weapon and cannot stack with itself.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierFirePosition = Take cover
    .desc = Take a fixed firing position; movement, damage, or changing weapons cancels it.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierSuppressionMode = Suppression mode
    .desc = Hits from a suitable weapon temporarily suppress NPCs near the impact point.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierDashToEmplacement = Dash to emplacement
    .desc = Physically move to a visible free point along a direct path.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierBarrelChange = Change barrel
    .desc = Begin a vulnerable stationary weapon-service window.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierBarrageCone = Barrage cone
    .desc = Empower NPC suppression from subsequent shots for a short window.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierCoverReload = Cover reload
    .desc = Briefly preserve pressure on nearby NPCs in direct sight.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierDeathLine = Death line
    .desc = Establish a powerful but interruptible suppression window.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierDownOrder = Down order
    .desc = Suppress a limited number of NPCs in the selected visible area.

wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-01-name = Hardened Body
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-01-description = Raises the critical-state threshold by 5.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-02-name = Reserve of Strength
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-02-description = Raises the critical stamina threshold by 5.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-03-name = Composure After a Fall
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-03-description = Newly applied knockdown lasts 10% less time.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-04-name = Light Step
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-04-description = Permanently increases walking and running speed by 1%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-05-name = Combat Dash
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-05-description = Dash 3 tiles: 10 stamina, 5-second cooldown, and only through a safe clear path.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-06-name = Stock Brace
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-06-description = Automatic weapons gain 10% less spread growth.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-07-name = Crew Resilience
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-07-description = Reduces only stamina damage dealt by enemy weapons by 15%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-08-name = Used to the Weight
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-08-description = Compensates 25% of the permanent movement penalty from holding an automatic weapon.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-09-name = Stable Mount
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-09-description = Reduces extra automatic-weapon spread while moving by 20%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-10-name = Fire Position
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-10-description = For 30 seconds, slows you by 50%, reduces incoming damage by 30%, and improves spread control.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-11-name = Firing Rhythm
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-11-description = Increases automatic-weapon fire rate by 10%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-12-name = Impulse Damping
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-12-description = Reduces automatic-weapon spread growth by 20%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-13-name = Heavy Step
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-13-description = Compensates 25% of the automatic weapon's post-shot movement penalty.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-14-name = Move in Bursts
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-14-description = Adds another 25% compensation to the post-shot movement penalty.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-15-name = Barrage
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-15-description = Raises any gun's fire rate by 50% for 10 seconds but blocks reloading.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-16-name = Combat Grip
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-16-description = Raises the light attack rate of compatible melee weapons by 10%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-17-name = Stock Strike
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-17-description = Raises compatible melee weapon damage by 8%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-18-name = Close-Quarters Resilience
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-18-description = Reduces only stamina damage dealt by enemy weapons by 15%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-19-name = Heavy Swing
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-19-description = Reduces the stamina cost of compatible heavy melee attacks by 25%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-20-name = Break the Line
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-20-description = Your next hit within 4 seconds deals 30% more damage and triggers a safe dash in the strike direction.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-21-name = Shed the Weight
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-21-description = Reduces Combat Dash cost to 5 stamina.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-22-name = Short Throw
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-22-description = Reduces Combat Dash cooldown to 3 seconds.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-23-name = Move Under Fire
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-23-description = Grants 5% speed for 1 second after Combat Dash.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-24-name = Proven Route
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-24-description = Increases Combat Dash range to 5 tiles.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-25-name = Assault Jump
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-steel-curtain-25-description = Replaces Combat Dash: grants 0.25 seconds of damage immunity and crosses only marked low barricades.

ent-ActionWh40kSoldierCombatDash = Combat Dash
    .desc = A directed dash along a safe clear path.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierAssaultJump = Assault Jump
    .desc = An improved dash through approved low obstacles.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierSteelFirePosition = Fire Position
    .desc = Take a protected but slow position for 30 seconds.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierSteelBarrage = Barrage
    .desc = Temporarily raise fire rate at the cost of reloading.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierSteelBreach = Break the Line
    .desc = Prepare one empowered melee hit and a dash after it.
